{{Basis}}
The '''Ottelian language''' is an [[Ottelic languages|Ottelic language]] that originated in the ancient region of [[Ottelia]] in [[Meran]]. 

==Writing system==
===Alphabet and IPA===
Ottelian is written with 38 letters of the [[Ottelian script]]<!--Deseret alphabet-->.

